description:
Add deterministic derived value computation for level-1 D&D 5e SRD character creation.

Minimum derived values
- ability modifiers;
- proficiency bonus;
- level-1 hit point maximum from class hit die plus Constitution modifier;
- spell save DC and spell attack modifier where applicable;
- passive Perception once skills are modeled;
- armor class once equipment is modeled;
- attack bonuses where practical.

HP must not be a required manual input in the default path. Manual HP override can be deferred as an advanced feature.

Acceptance criteria
- Fighter d10 with CON +2 computes level-1 HP 12.
- HP is not computed and no nonsense error is emitted when class or Constitution is missing/invalid.
- Derived values update when class, ancestry, ability scores, or equipment change.
- Tests cover HP prerequisites and recomputation.
